          "summary": "Let me start by listing services and then scanning error logs to find the spike. I'll use the compose tool to be efficient.\n\nPlan:\n1. List services.\n2. For each service, search ERROR logs across the day, count per hour or per page, find which service has a sustained burst.\n3. Get deploys for that service, find the one immediately preceding the spike start.\n4. Get owner email.\n5. Submit.\n\nLet me write a compose script that lists services, then for each service fetches all ERROR logs (paginating), aggregates counts per hour, and returns a summary.",
